title: The pure deletion of step_6 is staged from the line before it (21); index must hold only the four removed lines
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: let two = 2;\n    two\n\}\n[\s\S]*step_5\(\) -> u32 \{\n    5\n\}\n\nfn step_7[\s\S]*eleven\(\)
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
wait 600
part stage src/steps.rs 21
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
